  "description": "proposed single storey side/rear extension",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reason of the site being\r\nlocated within an area of land liable to flooding and the lack of a\r\ncomprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, due to a lack of&amp;nbsp;, due to a lack of up to date flood maps/data, compensatory flood\r\nstorage details and flood mitigation measures, has failed to demonstrate that\r\nthe proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the\r\nsite or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to\r\nthe National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI12 and SI13 of The\r\nLondon Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies\r\nDM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/p&gt;"
